{#
    语录排行榜模板

    - inline_css: 内联CSS样式
    
    - group_name: 群组名称
    - time: 时间
    - stats: 统计信息
        - total_quotes: 语录数量
        - pending_quotes: 待统计数量
        - contributors: 人数
        - average_quotes: 平均语录数量
    - ranking: 排行榜详情列表
        - author: 用户名称
        - count: 语录数量
        - percentage: 百分比
#}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>语录排行榜</title>
    <style>
        {{ inline_css | safe }}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container" style="--primary-color: {{ primary_color | default('#667eea') }}; --secondary-color: {{ secondary_color | default('#764ba2') }};">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>语录排行榜</h1>
            <div class="subtitle">{{ group_name }} · {{ time }}</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="stats-container">
            <div class="stats-grid">
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-number">{{ stats.total_quotes }}</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">总语录数</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-number">{{ stats.pending_quotes }}</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">待统计</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-number">{{ stats.contributors }}</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">贡献者</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-number">{{ stats.average_quotes }}</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">平均语录</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="stats-description">
                <p>这个群现在有 <span class="highlight">{{ stats.total_quotes }}</span> 条语录，聊天记录还有 <span class="highlight">{{ stats.pending_quotes }}</span> 没有统计呢~</p>
                <p><span class="highlight">{{ stats.contributors }}</span> 位群友被我记下了语录，平均每人 <span class="highlight">{{ stats.average_quotes }}</span> 条语录哦~</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="ranking-section">
            <h2 class="ranking-title">语录排行榜</h2>
            
            {% for item in ranking %}
            <div class="rank-item">
                <div class="rank-number">#{{ loop.index }}</div>
                <div class="rank-avatar">{{ item.author[0] if item.author else '?' }}</div>
                <div class="rank-name">{{ item.author }}</div>
                <div class="rank-bar-container">
                    <div class="rank-bar" style="width: {{ item.percentage }}%"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="rank-stats">
                    <div class="rank-count">{{ item.count }}</div>
                    <div class="rank-percentage">{{ item.percentage }}%</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>@ZikeQuote3 by LifeCheckpoint</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="decorative-bg"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>